WEBVTT

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.763
a battery swapping infrastructure where
you could drive in with your electric

00:06:03.763 --> 00:06:08.463
vehicle? We would swap the batteries and
you could drive out. Amazing idea.

00:06:08.463 --> 00:06:12.963
And they raised eight hundred and fifty
million dollars. But there's a problem.

00:06:12.997 --> 00:06:14.763
They fell in love with their idea,

00:06:15.197 --> 00:06:20.597
built the infrastructure of this battery
swapping stations and burned through

00:06:20.597 --> 00:06:22.263
the eight hundred and fifty
million dollars.

00:06:22.297 --> 00:06:25.897
And when too few customers showed up,
they couldn't pivot anymore.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:30.597
And this makes me very sad because
ventures like this should work